<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{.Title}}</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: light;
  --ink: #172129; --muted: #586770; --faint: #88969e;
  --paper: #eef3f5; --panel: #ffffff; --line: #d7e0e4; --line-strong: #aebdc4;
  --accent: #177f99; --accent-deep: #0b4c61; --accent-soft: #e0f1f5;
  --good: #11845f; --good-soft: #e3f5ed;
  --warn: #b46b18; --warn-soft: #fff1db;
  --bad: #b83f43; --bad-soft: #fbe6e7;
  --neutral: #647681; --neutral-soft: #edf1f3;
  --shadow-soft: 0 8px 24px rgba(19, 38, 48, 0.09);
  --radius: 16px;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }
body {
  color: var(--ink);
  background:
    repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(23, 33, 41, 0.03) 0 1px, transparent 1px 72px),
    linear-gradient(180deg, #fbfdfd, var(--paper));
  background-attachment: fixed;
  font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.wrap { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px 72px; }
header.top { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px 20px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.mark {
  width: 40px; height: 40px; flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center;
  border-radius: 11px; color: #fff; font: 800 0.72rem/1 ui-monospace, monospace;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #2aa7c3, #12677d 65%, #e59c49 150%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(42, 167, 195, 0.15);
}
h1 { font-size: 1.32rem; margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
.sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.82rem; margin-top: 2px; }
.meta { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-left: auto; text-align: right; }
h2 { font-size: 1.02rem; margin: 34px 0 12px; }
code {
  font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
  font-size: 0.84em; background: rgba(23, 127, 153, 0.1); color: var(--accent-deep);
  padding: 0.08em 0.4em; border-radius: 6px;
}
.tiles { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
.tile { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 15px 16px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); }
.tile .n { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.tile .k { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.76rem; margin-top: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
.tile.warn .n { color: var(--warn); }
.tile.bad .n { color: var(--bad); }
.tile.good .n { color: var(--good); }
.card { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft); overflow: hidden; }
table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.86rem; }
thead th { text-align: left; color: var(--muted); font-weight: 650; font-size: 0.72rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; padding: 11px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: #f7fafb; }
tbody td { padding: 10px 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
tr.run.has-findings { cursor: pointer; }
tr.run.has-findings:hover { background: var(--accent-soft); }
tr.run td .caret { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.7rem; margin-left: 5px; }
tr.findings-row > td { background: #f7fafb; padding: 0; }
tr.findings-row[hidden] { display: none; }
.findings-inner { padding: 6px 14px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.finding { border-left: 3px solid var(--neutral); background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-left-width: 3px; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px; }
.finding.sev-high { border-left-color: var(--bad); }
.finding.sev-medium { border-left-color: var(--warn); }
.finding.sev-low { border-left-color: var(--accent); }
.finding.sev-info { border-left-color: var(--neutral); }
.finding-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.finding p { margin: 4px 0; }
.finding .cost { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
.finding .suggest { color: var(--good); font-size: 0.82rem; }
.badge { font-size: 0.68rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--neutral-soft); color: var(--neutral); }
.badge.sev-high { background: var(--bad-soft); color: var(--bad); }
.badge.sev-medium { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
.badge.sev-low { background: var(--accent-soft); color: var(--accent-deep); }
.badge.fix { background: var(--good-soft); color: var(--good); }
.badge.api { background: var(--warn-soft); color: var(--warn); }
details.prompt { margin-top: 7px; }
details.prompt summary { cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-deep); font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 650; }
details.prompt pre { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; background: #0d1b22; color: #d7e7ec; padding: 12px 13px; border-radius: 9px; font-size: 0.78rem; margin: 8px 0 0; overflow-x: auto; }
.empty { color: var(--muted); background: var(--panel); border: 1px dashed var(--line-strong); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 26px; text-align: center; }
.note { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.78rem; margin-top: 8px; }
footer { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.76rem; margin-top: 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 14px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header class="top">
  <div class="brand">
    <div class="mark">c/r</div>
    <div>
      <h1>{{.Title}}</h1>
      <div class="sub">API Efficiency Advisor — rendered from the exported audit stream</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="meta">
    Generated {{.Generated}}{{if .Source}}<br>Source: {{.Source}}{{end}}
  </div>
</header>

{{if eq .TotalRuns 0}}
<div class="empty">No <code>code run</code> records found in the audit stream.</div>
{{else}}

<div class="tiles">
  <div class="tile"><div class="n">{{.TotalRuns}}</div><div class="k">Runs</div></div>
  <div class="tile"><div class="n">{{.TotalHostCalls}}</div><div class="k">Host calls</div></div>
  <div class="tile{{if .TotalFindings}} warn{{end}}"><div class="n">{{.TotalFindings}}</div><div class="k">Findings</div></div>
  <div class="tile good"><div class="n">{{.TotalAgentFixable}}</div><div class="k">Agent-fixable (route already granted)</div></div>
  <div class="tile{{if .TotalGrantRoute}} warn{{end}}"><div class="n">{{.TotalGrantRoute}}</div><div class="k">Route to grant (API has it)</div></div>
  <div class="tile{{if .TotalNoKnownRoute}} warn{{end}}"><div class="n">{{.TotalNoKnownRoute}}</div><div class="k">No known route</div></div>
  <div class="tile{{if .TotalAddedLatencyMs}} bad{{end}}"><div class="n">{{ms .TotalAddedLatencyMs}}</div><div class="k">Modelled latency beyond one call</div></div>
  <div class="tile"><div class="n">{{.TotalExtraCalls}}</div><div class="k">Extra calls</div></div>
  <div class="tile"><div class="n">{{bytes .TotalBytesMoved}}</div><div class="k">Bytes moved</div></div>
</div>

{{if .Profiles}}
<h2>Profiles by modelled latency beyond one call</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Profile</th><th class="num">Runs</th><th class="num">Host calls</th><th class="num">Findings</th><th class="num">Agent-fixable</th><th class="num">To grant</th><th class="num">No known route</th><th class="num">Extra calls</th><th class="num">Modelled latency</th><th class="num">Bytes</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {{range .Profiles}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{if .Profile}}<code>{{.Profile}}</code>{{else}}<span class="note">(none)</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.Runs}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.HostCalls}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.Findings}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.AgentFixable}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.GrantRoute}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.NoKnownRoute}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.ExtraCalls}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ms .AddedLatencyMs}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{bytes .BytesMoved}}</td>
    </tr>
  {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{end}}

{{if .Patterns}}
<h2>Patterns detected</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Worst severity</th><th>Remedy</th><th class="num">Count</th><th class="num">Agent-fixable</th><th class="num">Extra calls</th><th class="num">Modelled latency</th><th class="num">Bytes</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {{range .Patterns}}
    <tr>
      <td>{{prettyPattern .Pattern}}</td>
      <td><span class="badge sev-{{sevKey .Severity}}">{{.Severity}}</span></td>
      <td><code>{{.Remedy}}</code></td>
      <td class="num">{{.Count}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.AgentFixable}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.ExtraCalls}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ms .AddedLatencyMs}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{bytes .BytesMoved}}</td>
    </tr>
  {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
{{else}}
<h2>Patterns detected</h2>
<div class="empty">No efficiency findings in these runs. Either the traced calls were efficient, or advice was not enabled on the profiles that ran.</div>
{{end}}

<h2>Runs</h2>
<div class="card">
<table>
  <thead><tr><th>Time (UTC)</th><th>Trace</th><th>Profile</th><th>Sandbox</th><th class="num">Exit</th><th class="num">Duration</th><th class="num">Host calls</th><th class="num">Findings</th><th class="num">Waste</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {{range .Runs}}
    <tr class="run{{if .Findings}} has-findings{{end}}"{{if .Findings}} data-target="run-{{.ID}}"{{end}}>
      <td>{{if .When}}{{.When}}{{else}}<span class="note">—</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td>{{if .TraceID}}<code>{{.TraceID}}</code>{{else}}<span class="note">—</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td>{{if .Profile}}<code>{{.Profile}}</code>{{else}}<span class="note">(none)</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td>{{.Sandbox}}{{if .Isolation}} <span class="note">/ {{.Isolation}}</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.ExitCode}}{{if .TimedOut}} ⏱{{end}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ms .DurationMs}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.HostCalls}}{{if .HostCallsDenied}} <span class="note">({{.HostCallsDenied}} denied)</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{.FindingCount}}{{if .Findings}}<span class="caret">▸</span>{{end}}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ms .AddedLatencyMs}}</td>
    </tr>
    {{if .Findings}}
    <tr class="findings-row" id="run-{{.ID}}" hidden><td colspan="8">
      <div class="findings-inner">
      {{range .Findings}}
        <div class="finding sev-{{sevKey .Severity}}">
          <div class="finding-head">
            <span class="badge">{{prettyPattern .Pattern}}</span>
            <span class="badge sev-{{sevKey .Severity}}">{{.Severity}}</span>
            {{if .AgentFixable}}<span class="badge fix">agent-fixable</span>{{else if .GrantRoute}}<span class="badge api">grant a route</span>{{else}}<span class="badge api">no known route</span>{{end}}
            <code>{{.Method}} {{.Route}}</code>
          </div>
          <p>{{.Detail}}</p>
          {{$c := cost .}}{{if $c}}<p class="cost">{{$c}}</p>{{end}}
          {{if .SuggestedRoute}}<p class="suggest">Better route already granted: <code>{{.SuggestedMethod}} {{.SuggestedRoute}}</code> — the agent can switch to it now.</p>{{end}}
          {{if .GrantRoute}}<p class="suggest">The API exposes <code>{{.GrantRouteMethod}} {{.GrantRoute}}</code> but this profile does not grant it. Operator action: add that one route to the profile's <code>allow</code> list. No API change is needed.</p>{{end}}
          {{if eq (printf "%s" .Class) "no-known-route"}}<p class="note">No granted route covers this, and the profile's catalog names none either — which may mean the API has no such endpoint, or that the profile declares no catalog to check. Confirm before treating it as missing.</p>{{end}}
          {{if .DesignPrompt}}<details class="prompt"><summary>API-design prompt for this finding</summary><pre>{{.DesignPrompt}}</pre></details>{{end}}
        </div>
      {{end}}
      </div>
    </td></tr>
    {{end}}
  {{end}}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p class="note">Click a run with findings to expand its efficiency detail.</p>

{{end}}

<footer>
  <p><b>The advisor is a work in progress, and off unless a profile asks for it.</b> Two detectors ship today
  (a fan-out over a per-item route, and repeated reads of one fixed route) and the rule set is not settled: two
  earlier detectors were removed once it was clear the trace could not support them. A finding is evidence about
  one run, not a verdict on the API. Read the costs as modelled, not measured: "extra calls" compares the pattern
  with an assumed ideal of one call, and the latency is summed round trips beyond that, not wall time lost.</p>
  <p>plimsoll Prospector · every value above is metadata only — route templates, verbs, counts, and timings — never a request path, body, or credential.</p>
</footer>
</div>
<script>
(function () {
  var rows = document.querySelectorAll("tr.run.has-findings");
  for (var i = 0; i < rows.length; i++) {
    rows[i].addEventListener("click", function () {
      var id = this.getAttribute("data-target");
      var panel = document.getElementById(id);
      if (!panel) return;
      panel.hidden = !panel.hidden;
      var caret = this.querySelector(".caret");
      if (caret) caret.textContent = panel.hidden ? "▸" : "▾";
    });
  }
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
